{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/f5535bd8987c64f89d2997c16229b4ef.avif?t=1769585740\" width=600 height=136 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re:Night is a roguelike deckbuilder merged with tactical combat. In each adventure, players build their deck to defeat powerful enemies, from Slimes to Vampires, on a grid-based battlefield. Aggro, OTK, Control... diverse archetypes can all turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In combat, you control three characters simultaneously, enabling unique tactical maneuvers like establishing front/back ranks, flanking, body-blocking, and providing cover. Thanks to the innovative elemental crit system, any trio of heroes unlocks over 20+ build archetypes, with countless small combos to discover! Players will reap unprecedented creative joy and a thrilling, emergent experience within this deep strategic freedom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come to this town, end the night's cycle with your own hands, and let the dawn return to the land! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/a7554d3ec4e7238c56a01f150ca83dc5.avif?t=1769585740\" width=600 height=107 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control three characters simultaneously, each with a unique role \u2014 tank in the front, deal damage from the back, or flank from the side. On diverse and engaging maps, you must leverage your characters' traits, your deck's strengths, and the battlefield's elemental properties to claim victory through pure strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/dde6a7e7d484973de8611046d4159e2c.poster.avif?t=1769585740\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/dde6a7e7d484973de8611046d4159e2c.webm?t=1769585740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/dde6a7e7d484973de8611046d4159e2c.mp4?t=1769585740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/9594377590ab26f82a054e95cca56b1d.avif?t=1769585740\" width=600 height=99 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash devastating damage with the game's elemental crit system, built on a classic Fire-Water-Grass counter cycle. How will your three heroes coordinate to trigger powerful crits? How will you position them to prevent the enemy from doing the same? This high-stakes battle of wits is like a top-tier chess match, requiring careful planning and the ability to adapt to any situation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/a0097a40e06f199c1aa198a320e00835.poster.avif?t=1769585740\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/a0097a40e06f199c1aa198a320e00835.webm?t=1769585740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/a0097a40e06f199c1aa198a320e00835.mp4?t=1769585740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/9d5f2e860e2640484414b5925ee8da73.avif?t=1769585740\" width=600 height=89 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has unique talents and a massive library of class cards. With 300+ cards and 100+ pieces of equipment and items, any three-hero team can be built into over 20 different archetypes. Will you run a Tri-Color Cycle? A One-Punch build? Chain Thrust? Bomb Detonation? A sky-falling Phoenix? Even a basic mud wall can be turned from trash into treasure in countless ways! Here, you will crush your enemies with pure creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/da26fae5c663128045fc28e6aff4efaf.poster.avif?t=1769585740\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/da26fae5c663128045fc28e6aff4efaf.webm?t=1769585740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/da26fae5c663128045fc28e6aff4efaf.mp4?t=1769585740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/54eafbae1f6a0b7a7a4166f8fdfe09cb.avif?t=1769585740\" width=600 height=114 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a new experience, filled with diverse maps, events, combat, and encounters. Start at the stream, fight your way through the corrupted village, and finally ascend the castle where the secret lies! Unlock more content, new characters, and high-difficulty advanced challenges in every adventure. This is a game for those who are not afraid of a challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/6b30af0ee8b14b1f38a9276955bbc872.poster.avif?t=1769585740\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/6b30af0ee8b14b1f38a9276955bbc872.webm?t=1769585740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/6b30af0ee8b14b1f38a9276955bbc872.mp4?t=1769585740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/ca0a3091f29e2c2d0446f7068ae04517.avif?t=1769585740\" width=600 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why does the night loop? Why have elemental creatures invaded the village? What are the heroes and bosses fighting for? Collect chrono shards to piece together the past. Complete a series of brain-teasing OTK challenge levels to unlock each character's exclusive cards, equipment, and story events. Once you've gathered all the memories, you will see the truth hidden within the darkness and finally unravel the mystery of the cycle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/f1775784a1bdb191dfc1923088f06521.poster.avif?t=1769585740\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/f1775784a1bdb191dfc1923088f06521.webm?t=1769585740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/f1775784a1bdb191dfc1923088f06521.mp4?t=1769585740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2372240?t=1769585740","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/d68abe32cbbeae21e183929289aa09d0074f57d2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769585740","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/5ab9ede8f12e1802467969ea43170a4e26241068/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769585740","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/5ab9ede8f12e1802467969ea43170a4e26241068/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769585740","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3887780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/f5535bd8987c64f89d2997c16229b4ef.avif?t=1769585740\" width=600 height=136 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re:Night is a roguelike deckbuilder merged with tactical combat. In each adventure, players build their deck to defeat powerful enemies, from Slimes to Vampires, on a grid-based battlefield. Aggro, OTK, Control... diverse archetypes can all turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In combat, you control three characters simultaneously, enabling unique tactical maneuvers like establishing front/back ranks, flanking, body-blocking, and providing cover. Thanks to the innovative elemental crit system, any trio of heroes unlocks over 20+ build archetypes, with countless small combos to discover! Players will reap unprecedented creative joy and a thrilling, emergent experience within this deep strategic freedom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come to th