r the past. Complete a series of brain-teasing OTK challenge levels to unlock each character's exclusive cards, equipment, and story events. Once you've gathered all the memories, you will see the truth hidden within the darkness and finally unravel the mystery of the cycle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/f1775784a1bdb191dfc1923088f06521.poster.avif?t=1769585740\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/f1775784a1bdb191dfc1923088f06521.webm?t=1769585740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/extras/f1775784a1bdb191dfc1923088f06521.mp4?t=1769585740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Seahorse Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372240/9bcb24ad4a75bcfb629dca2420000cdfd0375374/header.jpg?t=1769585740","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2372240/803531147/ceac0f8b3fbee9ee0e6ea200d0f4cbc1ef1ce2ba/1760628097/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760636641","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2372240/803531147/ceac0f8b3fbee9ee0e6ea200d0f4cbc1ef1ce2ba/1760628097/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760636641","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2372240/803531147/ceac0f8b3fbee9ee0e6ea200d0f4cbc1ef1ce